// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3863839278" "The leader of the Resistance in Praetoria, Calvin Scott, just contacted Dark Watcher, who forwarded us the message. Anti-Matter has an orbital space lab that he used to stage the sneak attack the other day. Calvin Scott has given us the orbital coordinates and we think we can open a portal to Upsilon Beta 9-6 right inside that space station. We'd like you to <A HREF={ACCEPT}>lead a team onto this space station and uncover anything you can about a possible invasion.</A> Dark Watcher is commiting Vanguard troops to this operation as well, they will meet you on the station."
// AcceptString :
"P255302346" "Scout out the lab"
// SendOffString :
"P3476544730" "Anything you can find out will help."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2443399520" "Locate information on the invasion"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1539220565" "If Anti-Matter thinks he can get away with stealing Portal Corporation tech, he's got another thing coming."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2967923603" "<color deepskyblue>Part Three</color>"

