// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Leader3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2520675507" "You stopped the battle, but it seems that the Praetorian Clockworks confused the Carnival of Shadows for someone else."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1719783495" "Thanks to you, there weren't any casualties in Waxahachie Park. Calvin Scott informs us that on his world Vanessa DeVore leads the Carnival of Light, who fight against Anti-Matter at every turn. That must be why the invading Clockwork were so obessed with fighting them."
// RandomFameString :
"P3419593541" "{HeroName} saved my neighborhood from the Carnival and the Clockwork!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2741219322" "Before you try, I have pacified you. Your will is weak and I have made it so that we can have this conversation without your bloodlust for my head getting the better of you. Once you have left this warehouse, I will return your free will to yourself. Trust me, your mind is not a place I wish to be spending extended time in. Now, why have you barged in here and disrupted my troupe?"
// Answer Text :
"P3395723571" "I want to know what happened in Waxahachie park."
// Answer Text :
"P184344839" "What is your relationship to the Carnival of Light?"
// Answer Text :
"P2442360416" "Where does the Carnival of Shadows stand should we be invaded from another dimension?"
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"
// Page Menued Text :
"P2854403041" "I quickly tire of this conversation, please make haste."
// Answer Text :
"P368846060" "Where do you stand should this world be invaded from another dimension?"
// Answer Text :
"P779940212" "You know I am going to have to arrest you. The Carnival of Shadows must be shut down."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P113343961" "My troupe was just out to have a little fun, y'know? Cause a little mayhem, seed a little destruction, general good times. Then those robots came in, started calling us 'Carnival of Light', attacked us, then YOU showed up. You know the rest from there."
// Answer Text :
"P1777855872" "I have some more questions"
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P1438219688" "The Carnival of Light? It doesn't exist as far as I care. On this earth there is only the Carnival of Shadows. It's that other dimension where things are all opposite. That is where you find your Carnival of Light."
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P1992783710" "As long as there is fun to be had, my troupe and I will fight against whatever incurs here. But I warn you, the enemy of your enemy is not your friend in this case."
// Page EndPage Text :
"P1872083803" "Oh, I <i>do</i> know you'd love to arrest me. But answer me this, {HeroName}. How do you arrest an illusion?<br><br><color orange>You see Vanessa's image flicker. It seems the woman you're talking to now is just an astral projection of the real Vanessa DeVore.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P1242300966" "I'll bring you in one day, Vanessa."
// Page FinalPage Text :
"P4195370920" "<color orange>Vanessa's image laughs before it fades away.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P2385719541" "(Leave)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4056196789" "It was weird that the Carnival of Shadows had such a profound effect in confusing Anti-Matter's Clockwork invaders. We've got a tip about where the Carnival members who escaped the Battle of Waxahachie are holed up. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Go there and see if they have anything to further our understanding of the situation.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1869944113" "Learn what the Carnival knows about Anti-Matter and the attack."
// SendOffString :
"P1716706041" "Hopefully you can find someone in that hidey hole that is willing to speak to you about the matter at hand."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3088824891" "Talk to the person in charge"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2384279414" "We still need to know what the Carnival knows."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P397691594" "<color deepskyblue>Part Five</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
