// IntroString :
"P1734137450" "Last time you were in Anti-Matter's orbital lab you accessed some of the computers there, right? We've been going over that intel and it gave us a thread we need to pull on. Anti-Matter referred to his time acceleration experiment as Project: Deadline. We need everything we can get on Project: Deadline from his computers, which will be easier now that we know what we are looking for."
// AcceptString :
"P1775660247" "Search Anti-Matter's orbital lab for information on Project: Deadline"
// SendOffString :
"P3887717507" "One more thing. Seems that your team JUST missed encountering Anti-Matter himself on that station last time. I'd suggest bringing some allies along with you this time to be safe."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3067360363" "Defeat Anti-Matter & his Clockwork"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1544404602" "We still don't have much to go on. We need to know more about Anti-Matter!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1466364941" "<color deepskyblue>Part Six</color>"

