// IntroString :
"P1409864935" "I've got another Accel-Time dimension, it's the neighbor to Rho Mu 7-2, Rho Mu 7-3. Nearly identical, probably something in their dimensional make-up makes them ideal for this time-acceleration stuff to work there. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Go there and deactivate any of those devices you find and bring back any information on what Anti-Matter is up to there.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P886606111" "Shut down the time accelerators."
// SendOffString :
"P1384853138" "Learn whatever you can about Anti-Matter's ultimate plans."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1452243021" "Shut down all Time Accelerators"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2303630181" "Scans show Rho Mu 7-3 is still under time acceleration."
