// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P138120168" "The Clockwork who were trying to accelerate time were blue? Not brown, like Anti-Matter's? Sounds like Neuron, the Praetorian version of our own hero Synapse, is mimicking Anti-Matter's methods. His Clockwork have a color pattern like you describe."
// RandomFameString :
"P1760853339" "Sounds like {HeroName}'s up to the ears in Praetorian Clockwork."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission8 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1959712459" "From what we know, Neuron and Anti-Matter are the greatest of rivals on Praetorian Earth, unlike here where Positron and Synapse are the greatest of friends. It's obvious that one of them stole the idea for the accelerated construction from the other, we just need to know which one is which. One of the Resistance, Tunnel Rat, has given us coordinates for a lab in the Neuron Technologies Unlimited building. We want to <A HREF={ACCEPT}>rift you directly in and find out which one has amassed the larger army</A>, because that is the threat we need to stead ourselves from."
// AcceptString :
"P2156980959" "Go to Neuron's lab and uncover the information."
// SendOffString :
"P2271012067" "I can't believe that an arms race in another dimension is spilling over into ours."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1308580569" "Investigate Neuron's lab"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1138220249" "I need to know which of those two pioneered this accelerated time assembly line idea."
// TaskTitle :
"P4052288353" "<color deepskyblue>The Instant Army</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P26137137" "<color deepskyblue>Part Eight</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
