// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1791935530" "I can't make any sense of the political situation in Praetoria. It isn't like it used to be, back when they first invaded and we had no idea Anti-Matter and Neuron even knew each other, much less their rivalry. But those days are gone, and now it's all Praetor this and Praetor that. Thier Marcus Cole uses fear to instill structure and purpose, wraps it in a guise of a utopia, and then dupes the populace into thinking he's their hero and savior. Half their world think he's helping them, and the other half want to overthrow him.<br><br>Anyway, that's a bigger picture and a story we don't have time to delve into. For now, Marauder is locked down in the Zig, but for one of his power, it's only a matter of time before he's broken out."
// RandomFameString :
"P1784614391" "Did you see those soldiers over in Jamison Office Park? {HeroName} cleared them out."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission10 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1014882743" "If the Praetorians are planning any incursions into our world, we need as much warning as we can get. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I have five scanners that you can set up in the Praetorian dimension which will give us a heads up if they try anything on the scale we're expecting.</A><br><br>We will need to act quickly, as the scanners need approximately 24 hours to fully sync with the dimension they are placed in; I just hope we are getting these placed in time. We know that North America in the Praetorian dimension is mostly covered in dense forest thanks to the Devouring Earth there, so be on the lookout for any hero-eating plants that may be in the area."
// AcceptString :
"P1115703285" "Plant dimensional scanners"
// SendOffString :
"P628619286" "The Praetorian version of Woodsman, Shadowhunter, used to roam those forests, but we hear tell that the Devouring Earth finally caught up to him; he won't be bothering anyone any more."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4153822160" "Place Dimensional Scanners"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1218929853" "I need you to plant those dimensional scanners!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P55869162" "<color deepskyblue>Part Ten</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3046576870" "A sudden, shocking roar disrupts this tranquil stream."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - ScannersPlaced 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P379789779" "Praetoria Scanner"
// Description :
"P1065587649" "scanners to place"
// SingularDescription :
"P2686175867" "Place the final scanner"
// InteractBeginString :
"P4257226887" "You begin setting the scanner up."
// InteractInterruptedString :
"P244628908" "You've been interrupted!"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1663752908" "You have set the scanner."
// InteractActionString :
"P2147054684" "Establishing Uplink..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2952869549" "Here are the scanners. They will need to establish an uplink to our dimension immediately, but it will take up to a full day for them to start working properly and giving us the data we need."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2420080222" "You planted the dimensional scanners."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2410597400" "Those dimensional scanners should let us know if anybody from Praetorian Earth tries to enter our world again. I'm still mighty worried about Anti-Matter's attempt to invade our dimension. It sounds as if he might be getting close to a solution."
// RandomFameString :
"P1938683195" "{HeroName} is a big cheese over at Portal Corporation."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission11 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1298109464" "Looks like the Dimensional Scanners we established in Praetoria are not in sync yet because I am getting reports of a massive invasion force, led by Anti-Matter himself, inside Portal Corporation's labs. I think I need to educate my guys on the Praetorians, because someone mentioned it was Neuron, not Anti-Matter who was invading. I need you to gather a strong force of heroes and get down there and repel this invasion. Defeating the leader of the invading Clockworks should give us the edge we need to mop up. Vanguard already has a couple teams in the lab, but they are no match for these guys."
// AcceptString :
"P2389486159" "Stop Anti-Matter's invasion"
// SendOffString :
"P477346074" "According to the data, there are overwhelming forces in that lab. I'd take a full team along, if I were you."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P208368336" "Stop the invasion!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3710369063" "<color deepskyblue>The Final Chapter</color>"

